ps: Option -Z is not valid.
--- status
2

### ps -e
ps -e -o pid
--- out
PID
100
101

### ps -A
ps -A -o pid,device
--- out
PID DEVICE
100 -
101 -

### sleep zero
sleep 0; echo $?
--- out
0

### sleep advances the clock
date +%s; sleep 5; date +%s
--- out
1790000000
1790000005

### sleep a bad number
sleep abc
--- err
sleep: abc is not a valid number.
--- status
2

### sleep without an operand
sleep
--- err
sleep: A number of seconds is needed.
--- status
2

### sleep a negative number
sleep -1
--- err
sleep: -1 is not a valid number.
--- status
2

### uname
uname
