OS400

### uname -s
uname -s
--- out
OS400

### uname -n
uname -n
--- out
QS400

### uname -r and -v
uname -r; uname -v
--- out
0
1

### uname -m
uname -m
--- out
0000000

### uname -a
uname -a
--- out
OS400 QS400 0 1 0000000

### uname -sn
uname -sn
